<title>UK: SUEDWESTLB UNIT SETS $125 MLN STEP-DOWN BOND, CALL.</title>
<headline>SUEDWESTLB UNIT SETS $125 MLN STEP-DOWN BOND, CALL.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-08-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead</p>
<p>manager BZW.</p>
<p> BORROWER   SUEDWESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK CAPITAL MARKETS PLC</p>
<p>GUARANTOR  SUEDWESTDEUTSCHE LANDESBANK GZ</p>
<p> AMT    $125 MLN	COUPON   **7.5	 MATURITY  **10.SEP.07</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-DOWN     ISS PRICE  100.075   PAY DATE    10.SEP.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  32.5 BP   REOFFER    100.075   SPREAD    **+104 BP</p>
<p> NOTES    **UNTIL 10.SEP.99 WHEN COUPON STEPS DOWN TO 7.125 PCT,</p>
<p>		+68 BP, IF NOT CALLED AT PAR</p>
<p> MOODY	AAA	 LISTING    LONDON    PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AAA	 DENOMS (K) 1-10	SALE LIMITS US/UK/GE</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   HOME CTRY  GERMANY   TAX PROVS   STD</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
